                                                                    Permission

A permission is a setting on one specific object. It says who can access that object (a user, team, group, job role, company or everyone) and at what level: View, Contribute or Manage.
It is about access to one object.

Example: “The project ‘Diwali landing page’ is shared with the Website Team at Contribute.”

Permission	  What it allows
View	        See the object, add documents, see cost, billing and general finance information, and share it (only up to their own level)
Contribute	  Everything in View, plus add expenses and tasks (on projects), edit custom forms, log hours and make assignments
Manage	      Everything in View and Contribute, plus delete the object and manage cost rates, billing rates and finance data

